### Create Workflow
POST http://localhost:8080/workflow
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "Age verification",
    "description": "verify age is above 18 and send email"
}

### Get Workflow
GET http://localhost:8080/workflow/3

### Generate DSL
POST http://localhost:8080/workflow/3/generate-dsl

### Update Workflow
PUT http://localhost:8080/workflow/2
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "Age verification",
    "description": "verify age is above 21"
}

### Delete Workflow
DELETE http://localhost:8080/workflow/3

### Execute Workflow
POST http://localhost:8080/workflow/3/execute
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "John Doe",
